  aciklama:
  - "Bu aya Arap\xE7a k\xF6kenli, ay\u0131ran, b\xF6len anlam\u0131na gelen \"kas\u0131m\"
    ad\u0131 verilmi\u015F."
  - "\xC7in'de uzun \xF6m\xFCr ve dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131k simgesi olarak kullan\u0131lan,
    kas\u0131m ay\u0131nda patlay\u0131veren \"kas\u0131mpat\u0131\" ay\u0131nda
    d\xFCnyaya gelmi\u015Fsin. Bu \xE7i\xE7e\u011Fin di\u011Fer ad\u0131 da krizantem'dir."
